"{\"title\":\"Mini Wars Patch Notes — Live Build Update Log & Changelog · Mini Wars Wiki\",\"url\":\"/patch-notes\",\"h1\":\"MINI WARS PATCH NOTES\",\"mainHTML\":\"<main class=\\\"relative z-10 flex-1\\\"><section class=\\\"relative border-b border-camo-900/80 bg-bunker-950/40 overflow-hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-50\\\"></div><div class=\\\"absolute -top-20 -right-20 h-60 w-60 rounded-full bg-ember-500/10 blur-3xl\\\"></div><div class=\\\"relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-14 md:py-20\\\"><div class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-ember-500 mb-3 flex items-center gap-3\\\"><span class=\\\"h-px w-8 bg-ember-500\\\"></span>LOG · UPDATES</div><h1 class=\\\"font-display text-4xl md:text-6xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100\\\">Mini Wars Patch Notes</h1><p class=\\\"mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base md:text-lg text-bunker-300 leading-relaxed\\\">Mini Wars ships as a Live Build, not on a numbered patch cadence. Below are the most notable rolling updates — sourced from developer announcements and observable in-game changes. Read the diff before you blame your build order.</p><div class=\\\"mt-6\\\"><div class=\\\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-ember-700/70 text-ember-300\\\">Live Build · May 2026</span><span class=\\\"chip\\\">3<!-- --> entries</span><span class=\\\"chip\\\">Updated <!-- -->May 06, 2026</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\\\"relative border-b border-camo-900/60 bg-bunker-950/40\\\"><div class=\\\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-10 md:py-14\\\"><div class=\\\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12\\\"><div class=\\\"lg:col-span-8 space-y-6\\\"><div class=\\\"font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-ember-500\\\">ABOUT THE CHANGELOG</div><div class=\\\"prose-tactical text-base md:text-lg text-bunker-200 leading-relaxed space-y-4\\\"><p>These are the official-equivalent <strong>Mini Wars patch notes</strong> <!-- -->for the Roblox country-conquest game by Horangi99. Mini Wars does not ship on a numbered release cycle — it is a Live Build, meaning balance tuning, new buildings, and bug fixes drop continuously, often without an in-game announcement banner. Each entry below documents what observably changed: which numbers moved, which buildings were added, and which strategies got quieter or louder as a result.</p><p>The latest entry sits at the top. After every shipped update we re-calibrate the<!-- --> <a class=\\\"text-ember-400 underline-offset-2 hover:underline\\\" href=\\\"/tier-list\\\">Mini Wars tier list</a> <!-- -->and refresh affected<!-- --> <a class=\\\"text-ember-400 underline-offset-2 hover:underline\\\" href=\\\"/buildings\\\">building entries</a>. If a strategy on the<!-- --> <a class=\\\"text-ember-400 underline-offset-2 hover:underline\\\" href=\\\"/strategy\\\">strategies page</a> <!-- -->suddenly stops working, this changelog is the first place to check.</p></div><div class=\\\"grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 pt-4\\\"><div class=\\\"hud-frame clip-corner-sm p-5 bg-bunker-900/40\\\"><h2 class=\\\"font-display text-lg uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 mb-2\\\">How updates ship</h2><div class=\\\"text-sm text-bunker-300 leading-relaxed space-y-2\\\"><p>Mini Wars patches arrive without version numbers in-game. The dev team announces some changes in the official Discord; others land silently and get spotted by players in the next match.</p><p>We assign internal version tags (<span class=\\\"text-sand-100\\\">Live Build · May 2026</span> <!-- -->is the latest) so you can reference a specific build in guides and bug reports.</p></div></div><div class=\\\"hud-frame clip-corner-sm p-5 bg-bunker-900/40\\\"><h2 class=\\\"font-display text-lg uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 mb-2\\\">How we track changes</h2><div class=\\\"text-sm text-bunker-300 leading-relaxed space-y-2\\\"><p><span class=\\\"text-sand-100\\\">Source 1</span>: developer posts in the official Mini Wars Discord and Roblox group feed.</p><p><span class=\\\"text-sand-100\\\">Source 2</span>: in-game observation — building costs, output rates, and unlock conditions are diffed match-to-match.</p><p><span class=\\\"text-sand-100\\\">Source 3</span>: community reports in the official Discord, cross-validated before inclusion.</p></div></div></div></div><aside class=\\\"lg:col-span-4\\\"><div class=\\\"hud-frame clip-corner p-5 bg-bunker-900/40 sticky top-24\\\"><div class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-ember-500 mb-4\\\">Jump to</div><ul class=\\\"space-y-1.5\\\"><li><a class=\\\"group flex items-center gap-2 border border-transparent hover:border-camo-700/70 hover:bg-bunker-900/70 px-3 py-2 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"#latest\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3.5 w-3.5 text-ember-500/70 group-hover:text-ember-400\\\"><path d=\\\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\\\"></path></svg><span class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-bunker-200 group-hover:text-sand-100\\\">Latest patch</span></a></li><li><a class=\\\"group flex items-center gap-2 border border-transparent hover:border-camo-700/70 hover:bg-bunker-900/70 px-3 py-2 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"#all\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3.5 w-3.5 text-ember-500/70 group-hover:text-ember-400\\\"><path d=\\\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\\\"></path></svg><span class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-bunker-200 group-hover:text-sand-100\\\">Full changelog</span></a></li><li><a class=\\\"group flex items-center gap-2 border border-transparent hover:border-camo-700/70 hover:bg-bunker-900/70 px-3 py-2 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/tier-list\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3.5 w-3.5 text-ember-500/70 group-hover:text-ember-400\\\"><path d=\\\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\\\"></path></svg><span class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-bunker-200 group-hover:text-sand-100\\\">Tier list</span></a></li><li><a class=\\\"group flex items-center gap-2 border border-transparent hover:border-camo-700/70 hover:bg-bunker-900/70 px-3 py-2 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/buildings\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3.5 w-3.5 text-ember-500/70 group-hover:text-ember-400\\\"><path d=\\\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\\\"></path></svg><span class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-bunker-200 group-hover:text-sand-100\\\">Buildings</span></a></li><li><a class=\\\"group flex items-center gap-2 border border-transparent hover:border-camo-700/70 hover:bg-bunker-900/70 px-3 py-2 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/strategy\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3.5 w-3.5 text-ember-500/70 group-hover:text-ember-400\\\"><path d=\\\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\\\"></path></svg><span class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-bunker-200 group-hover:text-sand-100\\\">Strategies</span></a></li><li><a class=\\\"group flex items-center gap-2 border border-transparent hover:border-camo-700/70 hover:bg-bunker-900/70 px-3 py-2 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/codes\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3.5 w-3.5 text-ember-500/70 group-hover:text-ember-400\\\"><path d=\\\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\\\"></path></svg><span class=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-bunker-200 group-hover:text-sand-100\\\">Codes tracker</span></a></li></ul></div></aside></div></div></section><section id=\\\"all\\\" class=\\\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 space-y-10 scroll-mt-24\\\"><h2 class=\\\"sr-only\\\">Full Mini Wars changelog</h2><article id=\\\"latest\\\" class=\\\"hud-frame clip-corner p-6 md:p-8 relative scroll-mt-24\\\"><span class=\\\"absolute -top-3 left-6 chip border-ember-500/60 bg-bunker-950 text-ember-400\\\">· Latest ·</span><div class=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-3 mb-1\\\"><h2 class=\\\"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100\\\">Live Build · May 2026</h2><span class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-ember-400\\\">Industrial Depth &amp; Stability Pass</span><span class=\\\"ml-auto font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-300\\\">May 06, 2026</span></div><div class=\\\"my-5 grid gap-2\\\"><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 border-l-2 border-ember-500/60 bg-bunker-900/40 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-bunker-100\\\"><span class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ember-500 mt-0.5\\\">HL<!-- -->01</span><span>Oil Rig surfaced as a top-level Production building; Steel Mill chain refreshed.</span></div><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 border-l-2 border-ember-500/60 bg-bunker-900/40 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-bunker-100\\\"><span class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ember-500 mt-0.5\\\">HL<!-- -->02</span><span>Bunker added to the defensive build menu — a hardened mid-tier garrison structure.</span></div><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 border-l-2 border-ember-500/60 bg-bunker-900/40 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-bunker-100\\\"><span class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ember-500 mt-0.5\\\">HL<!-- -->03</span><span>Server stability significantly improved during peak hours.</span></div><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 border-l-2 border-ember-500/60 bg-bunker-900/40 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-bunker-100\\\"><span class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ember-500 mt-0.5\\\">HL<!-- -->04</span><span>Storage Center auto-collect radius and consistency tightened.</span></div><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 border-l-2 border-ember-500/60 bg-bunker-900/40 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-bunker-100\\\"><span class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ember-500 mt-0.5\\\">HL<!-- -->05</span><span>Workshop builder allocation now re-balances correctly when buildings are sold.</span></div></div><div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\"><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/60 text-camo-200 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\">Buildings</span><span class=\\\"text-bunker-200\\\">Oil Rig: production node for Oil resource, available as a mid-tier industrial unlock. Free Oil Rig reward live for accounts joining the official Roblox group.</span></div><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/60 text-camo-200 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\">Buildings</span><span class=\\\"text-bunker-200\\\">Steel Mill: surfaced as an explicit chain step between Wood Plant and military buildings — Steel is now the gating material for Tank Base / Air Base / Missile Launcher.</span></div><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/60 text-camo-200 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\">Buildings</span><span class=\\\"text-bunker-200\\\">Bunker: hardened defensive structure that garrisons soldiers and absorbs significantly more damage than a Border Tower.</span></div><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/60 text-camo-200 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\">Buildings</span><span class=\\\"text-bunker-200\\\">Storage Center: collection radius behaviour tightened to be more consistent across cluster sizes.</span></div><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-signal-600/40 text-signal-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\">Balance</span><span class=\\\"text-bunker-200\\\">Barracks role clarified — primary purpose is civilian recruitment, with soldier training as a secondary toggle. Tier rating raised from B to A in community consensus.</span></div><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-sand-700/60 text-sand-200 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\">Economy</span><span class=\\\"text-bunker-200\\\">Market price-swing volatility re-tuned — fewer extreme dips, slightly fewer extreme surges.</span></div><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-600 text-bunker-200 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\">Bugfix</span><span class=\\\"text-bunker-200\\\">Builders no longer get stuck on demolished foundations after a sell.</span></div><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-ember-500/60 text-ember-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\">Feature</span><span class=\\\"text-bunker-200\\\">Free Oil Rig reward for joining the official Roblox group is live for new accounts.</span></div></div></article><article class=\\\"hud-frame clip-corner p-6 md:p-8 relative scroll-mt-24\\\"><div class=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-3 mb-1\\\"><h2 class=\\\"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100\\\">Live Build · April 2026</h2><span class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-ember-400\\\">Air Power Tuning</span><span class=\\\"ml-auto font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-300\\\">Apr 18, 2026</span></div><div class=\\\"my-5 grid gap-2\\\"><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 border-l-2 border-ember-500/60 bg-bunker-900/40 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-bunker-100\\\"><span class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ember-500 mt-0.5\\\">HL<!-- -->01</span><span>Black Hawk units re-balanced to reinforce the Air Base + Missile Launcher meta.</span></div><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 border-l-2 border-ember-500/60 bg-bunker-900/40 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-bunker-100\\\"><span class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ember-500 mt-0.5\\\">HL<!-- -->02</span><span>Tank Base offense pass — slight buff to keep ground viable as a complement to air.</span></div><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 border-l-2 border-ember-500/60 bg-bunker-900/40 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-bunker-100\\\"><span class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ember-500 mt-0.5\\\">HL<!-- -->03</span><span>New Border Tower placement preview added.</span></div></div><div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\"><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-ember-700/60 text-ember-300 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\">Military</span><span class=\\\"text-bunker-200\\\">Black Hawks: damage profile re-tuned, slightly fewer one-shot trades against fortified defenses.</span></div><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-ember-700/60 text-ember-300 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\">Military</span><span class=\\\"text-bunker-200\\\">Tank Base: offense raised to retain combined-arms relevance.</span></div><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-camo-700/60 text-camo-200 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\">Buildings</span><span class=\\\"text-bunker-200\\\">Border Tower: placement preview now shows coverage radius before purchase.</span></div><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-signal-600/40 text-signal-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\">Balance</span><span class=\\\"text-bunker-200\\\">General cooldowns slightly reduced after defeat to encourage re-engagement.</span></div></div></article><article class=\\\"hud-frame clip-corner p-6 md:p-8 relative scroll-mt-24\\\"><div class=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-3 mb-1\\\"><h2 class=\\\"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100\\\">Live Build · March 2026</h2><span class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-ember-400\\\">Foundation Update</span><span class=\\\"ml-auto font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-camo-300\\\">Mar 09, 2026</span></div><div class=\\\"my-5 grid gap-2\\\"><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 border-l-2 border-ember-500/60 bg-bunker-900/40 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-bunker-100\\\"><span class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ember-500 mt-0.5\\\">HL<!-- -->01</span><span>Statues (Worker / Soldier) added to the visible build menu — previously hidden in submenus.</span></div><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 border-l-2 border-ember-500/60 bg-bunker-900/40 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-bunker-100\\\"><span class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ember-500 mt-0.5\\\">HL<!-- -->02</span><span>Base map expansion costs lowered for the first two land purchases.</span></div><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 border-l-2 border-ember-500/60 bg-bunker-900/40 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-bunker-100\\\"><span class=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ember-500 mt-0.5\\\">HL<!-- -->03</span><span>New player onboarding flow adds Workshop guidance.</span></div></div><div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\"><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-ember-500/60 text-ember-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\">Feature</span><span class=\\\"text-bunker-200\\\">Worker Statue and Soldier Statue surfaced as top-level build menu entries.</span></div><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-sand-700/60 text-sand-200 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\">Economy</span><span class=\\\"text-bunker-200\\\">First two land expansion purchases reduced in price to ease early scaling.</span></div><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-ember-500/60 text-ember-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\">Feature</span><span class=\\\"text-bunker-200\\\">New player tutorial nudges Workshop purchase before second income source.</span></div><div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm\\\"><span class=\\\"chip border-bunker-600 text-bunker-200 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\">Bugfix</span><span class=\\\"text-bunker-200\\\">Civilian count now updates immediately on House demolition, not on the next tick.</span></div></div></article><div class=\\\"hud-frame clip-corner p-6 md:p-8 bg-bunker-900/40\\\"><h2 class=\\\"font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100 mb-4\\\">What to do after a Mini Wars patch</h2><div class=\\\"grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-3 text-sm\\\"><a class=\\\"hud-frame clip-corner-sm p-3 hover:border-ember-500/70 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/tier-list\\\"><div class=\\\"font-display uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100\\\">Re-check tier list</div><div class=\\\"text-xs text-bunker-400 mt-1\\\">Calibrated after every shipped update.</div></a><a class=\\\"hud-frame clip-corner-sm p-3 hover:border-ember-500/70 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/strategy\\\"><div class=\\\"font-display uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100\\\">Adjust your strategy</div><div class=\\\"text-xs text-bunker-400 mt-1\\\">Archetype guides updated alongside patches.</div></a><a class=\\\"hud-frame clip-corner-sm p-3 hover:border-ember-500/70 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/codes\\\"><div class=\\\"font-display uppercase tracking-wider text-sand-100\\\">Code tracker</div><div class=\\\"text-xs text-bunker-400 mt-1\\\">Redemption ships in a future patch — bookmark.</div></a></div></div></section></main>\",\"allNav\":[{\"href\":\"/buildings\",\"cls\":\"relative px-3 py-2 font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-widest transition-colors text-bunker-200 hover:text-sand-100\",\"color\":\"rgb(196, 203, 185)\",\"text\":\"BUILDINGS\"},{\"href\":\"/strategy\",\"cls\":\"relative px-3 py-2 font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-widest transition-colors text-bunker-200 hover:text-sand-100\",\"color\":\"rgb(196, 203, 185)\",\"text\":\"STRATEGY\"},{\"href\":\"/systems\",\"cls\":\"relative px-3 py-2 font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-widest transition-colors text-bunker-200 hover:text-sand-100\",\"color\":\"rgb(196, 203, 185)\",\"text\":\"SYSTEMS\"},{\"href\":\"/tier-list\",\"cls\":\"relative px-3 py-2 font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-widest transition-colors text-bunker-200 hover:text-sand-100\",\"color\":\"rgb(196, 203, 185)\",\"text\":\"TIER LIST\"},{\"href\":\"/guides\",\"cls\":\"relative px-3 py-2 font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-widest transition-colors text-bunker-200 hover:text-sand-100\",\"color\":\"rgb(196, 203, 185)\",\"text\":\"GUIDES\"},{\"href\":\"/codes\",\"cls\":\"relative px-3 py-2 font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-widest transition-colors text-bunker-200 hover:text-sand-100\",\"color\":\"rgb(196, 203, 185)\",\"text\":\"CODES\"},{\"href\":\"/news\",\"cls\":\"relative px-3 py-2 font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-widest transition-colors text-bunker-200 hover:text-sand-100\",\"color\":\"rgb(196, 203, 185)\",\"text\":\"NEWS\"},{\"href\":\"/patch-notes\",\"cls\":\"relative px-3 py-2 font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-widest transition-colors text-ember-400\",\"color\":\"rgb(255, 106, 58)\",\"text\":\"PATCH\"},{\"href\":\"/faq\",\"cls\":\"relative px-3 py-2 font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-widest transition-colors text-bunker-200 hover:text-sand-100\",\"color\":\"rgb(196, 203, 185)\",\"text\":\"FAQ\"}]}"
